    "body": "The current change of #488 resolves only ```remove()``` and ```toggle()``` cases, but doesn't resolve the case of https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/462#issuecomment-305378133. If we resolve all of them, I think we need to update 'Run the update steps.' in each of operations to 'Run the update steps if token set was updated in the prior steps'\r\n\r\n> I think no tests actually need changing, right? \r\n\r\nRight. I think the test has the desired behavior.\r\n",
